            "invisible": false,
            "solution": ""
          },
          {
            "x": 2.23463687150838,
            "y": 13.245033112582783,
            "width": 92.73743016759778,
            "height": 86.09271523178808,
            "action": {
              "library": "H5P.AdvancedText 1.1",
              "params": {
                "text": "<p><strong>Early Life of Constantine</strong><br>\nConstantine was born around 272 AD in Naissus, in present-day Serbia. His father was a respected Roman officer named Constantius, who would become one of the four emperors of the Tetrarchy. Constantine grew up in the imperial court and was exposed to Christian influences early in his life, although he was not initially a Christian. His mother, Helena, was a devout Christian and would later be declared a saint for her pious life and influence on her son.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Rise to Power</strong><br>\nAfter his father became the western Roman emperor, Constantine served with distinction in Diocletian's army. In 306 AD, Constantius died, and Constantine was proclaimed emperor by his father's troops. However, his ascent was challenged by Maxentius, the son of a former emperor. Constantine's claim to the throne was solidified only after he defeated Maxentius at the Battle of the Milvian Bridge in 312 AD.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Constantine's Vision</strong><br>\nBefore the Battle of the Milvian Bridge, Constantine reportedly had a vision of a cross in the sky with the words \"In this sign, conquer.\" He took this as a divine message and ordered his troops to mark their shields with a Christian symbol. His victory in the battle was seen as a sign of divine favor, and Constantine attributed his success to the Christian God, which led him to favor the Christian church more openly.</p>\n"
              },
              "metadata": {
                "contentType": "Text",
                "license": "U",
                "title": "Unbenannt: Text",
                "defaultLanguage": "en"
              },
              "subContentId": "53bc5361-5ce5-43a9-a00f-57bbceee9cd0"
            },
            "alwaysDisplayComments": false,
            "backgroundOpacity": 0,
            "displayAsButton": false,
